--   - WORKED_EXAMPLE: Step-by-step problem deconstruction with LaTeX math
--   - TRAPS_AND_PITFALLS: Exam traps, boundary edge cases, and elimination tactics
--   - CHEAT_SHEET: High-yield formulas, identities, and rapid recall shortcuts
-- Disciplines Covered (24 Subtopics x 4 Pedagogical Approaches = 96 Micro-Tutorials):
--   - Mathematics (Quantitative Aptitude):
--       * Arithmetic: Percentages, Profit & Loss, Simple Interest, Compound Interest, Time & Work, Time-Speed-Distance
--       * Algebra: Quadratic Equations, Algebraic Identities
--       * Geometry: Triangles & Geometric Properties
--   - Reasoning (General Intelligence):
--       * Deductive Logic: Syllogistic Reasoning (Standard & Only-A-Few)
--       * Sequences & Patterns: Number Series Progression
--       * Analytical Coding: Letter Coding & Reverse Transposition
--       * Mathematical Logic: Direct Inequalities & Priority Hierarchy
--   - General Science:
--       * Physics: Classical Mechanics (Newton's Laws), Geometrical Optics (Lenses & Refraction)
--       * Chemistry: Carbon Compounds & Hydrocarbons, Acids, Bases & Salts
--       * Biology: Cell Structure, Organelles & Cell Division
--   - Banking & Financial Awareness:
--       * Monetary Policy: RBI Policy Rates (Repo, SDF, MSF, CRR, SLR)
--       * Prudential Regulation: Capital Adequacy (Basel III, CET1, CRAR, D-SIBs)
--   - Indian Polity & Governance:
--       * Constitutional Foundations: Preamble & Constitutional Jurisprudence
--       * Civic Safeguards: Fundamental Rights & Five Prerogative Writs (Art 32/226)
--   - English Language & Comprehension:
--       * Error Detection: Dangling Participles, Misplaced & Squinting Modifiers
--   - Computer Science & Digital Tech:
--       * Networking: Collision & Broadcast Domains, Layer 2/3 Switching vs Routing, OSI Model
-- Standards:
--   - AGENTS.md LaTeX standard: All math expressions enclosed in $$ ... $$ delimiters
--   - PostgreSQL JSONB serialization with verified double-backslash escaping (\\)
--   - Deterministic UUIDs: b1010000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001 to b1010000-0000-0000-0000-000000000096
--   - Taxonomy fully resolved via JOIN LATERAL matching subject, topic, and subtopic
--   - Telemetry baselines seeded into lesson_effectiveness
--   - Multilingual localization seeded into microlesson_translation (Hindi)
-- =============================================================================

