        4,
        'Letter Coding & Reverse Pairs Mastery Cheat Sheet: Alphabet numerical coordinate systems and reciprocal opposite pairs (summing to 27). Mnemonic associations for all 13 opposite letter pairs: AZ (A-to-Z), BY (Boy), CX (Crux), DW (Dew), EV (Evening), FU (Full), GT (GT Road), HS (High School), IR (Indian Railway), JQ (Jungle Queen), KP (Kurta Pyjama), LO (Love), MN (Man).',
